#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:2
msgid "Getting Started with Terraform Instance Types"
msgstr "Getting Started con Terraform Instance Types"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:6
msgid ""
"`Terraform <https://www.terraform.io/intro/index.html>`_ is a common tool"
" that allows IT administrators to map out infrastructure as code in "
"configuration files and supports all of the popular providers used in the"
" modern datacenter. Once configured, Terraform will plan, deploy, and "
"manage the infrastructure as needed. Configuration files can be brought "
"under version control so teams can easily make changes to environments. "
"Infrastructure can also be monitored for drift and corrective action can "
"easily be taken."
msgstr ""
"`Terraform <https://www.terraform.io/intro/index.html>`_ is a common tool"
" that allows IT administrators to map out infrastructure as code in "
"archivos de configuración y supports todos of the popular providers used "
"in the modern datacenter. Una vez configurado, Terraform will plan, "
"deploy, y manage the infrastructure as needed. Configuration files puede "
"ser brought under version control so teams can easily make changes to "
"environments. Infrastructure can también be monitored for drift y "
"corrective action can easily be taken."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:8
msgid ""
"|morpheus| allows users to on-board or even draft Terraform spec "
"directly. With the configuration on-board, we can begin to piece together"
" infrastructure constructs into the |morpheus| Library as Layouts and "
"Instance Types. With the Library items staged, users can deploy new "
"infrastructure directly into the selected providers. Once deployed, "
"infrastructure can be monitored for drift from within |morpheus| UI. When"
" needed, we can plan and take corrective action easily from the detail "
"page of a |morpheus| Terraform Instance."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| permite a los usuarios on-board o even draft Terraform spec "
"directly. With la configuración on-board, we puede sergin to piece "
"together infrastructure constructs en the |morpheus| Library as Layouts y"
" Instance Types. With the Library items staged, users can deploy nuevo "
"infrastructure directly en the selected providers. Once deployed, "
"infrastructure puede ser monitored for drift desde dentro de |morpheus| "
"UI. When needed, we can plan y take corrective action easily desde the "
"detail page of a |morpheus| Terraform Instance."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:10
msgid ""
"In this section, we've discussed a high-level overview of Terraform and "
"working with Terraform in the |morpheus| context. In the next section, "
"we'll actually onboard Terraform spec, create Library items, and deploy "
"real infrastructure to AWS with |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"In this section, we've discussed a high-level overview of Terraform y "
"working con Terraform en la |morpheus| context. En la next section, we'll"
" actually onboard Terraform spec, create Library items, y deploy real "
"infrastructure to AWS con |morpheus|."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:13
msgid "Terraform Instance Types in Action"
msgstr "Terraform Instance Types in Action"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:15
msgid ""
"In this example, we're going to deploy a VPC and three subnets to AWS "
"using Terraform and |morpheus|. I've created Spec Templates to onboard "
"``.tf`` configuration files which handle the AWS provider (with assume "
"role for account flexibility), VPC creation, subnet creation, and "
"variable injection."
msgstr ""
"In this example, we're going to deploy a VPC y three subnets to AWS using"
" Terraform y |morpheus|. I've created Spec Templates to onboard ``.tf`` "
"configuration files which handle the AWS provider (with assume role for "
"account flexibility), VPC creation, subnet creation, y variable "
"injection."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:17
msgid ""
"We'll onboard the Terraform configuration files as modular Spec "
"Templates, create new Instance Types with custom Layouts for the "
"|morpheus| Library, and set up Inputs to inject variable values at "
"provision time. Once deployed, we'll take a look at the new "
"infrastructure in |morpheus| and go over the management capabilities for "
"the new environment."
msgstr ""
"We'll onboard the Terraform configuration files as modular Spec "
"Templates, create new Instance Types con custom Layouts para la "
"|morpheus| Library, y set up Inputs to inject variable values at "
"provision time. Once deployed, we'll take a look en la new infrastructure"
" in |morpheus| y go over the management capabilities para la new "
"environment."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:20
msgid "Spec Templates"
msgstr "Spec Templates"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:22
msgid ""
"Terraform configuration is stored as a Spec Template in |morpheus|. You "
"can store your configuration as one monolithic file for each Instance "
"Type you intend to create or you can create individual Spec Templates for"
" modular pieces which can be reused across multiple Instance Types. When "
"added to the Layout later, we'll be able to include as many Spec "
"Templates as we wish which enables us to reuse smaller modular pieces if "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"Terraform configuration is stored as a Spec Template in |morpheus|. You "
"can store your configuration as one monolithic file for each Instance "
"Type you intend to create o you can create individual Spec Templates for "
"modular pieces which puede ser reused across multiple Instance Types. "
"When added a la Layout later, we'll be able to include as many Spec "
"Templates as we wish which enables us to reuse smaller modular pieces if "
"desired."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:24
msgid ""
"Spec Templates are added in the |morpheus| Library (|LibTemSpe| tab). We "
"can pull in the template from some type of repository, such as through a "
"Github integration, or write new spec directly into the New Spec Template"
" modal. In most cases, the spec will be pre-existing and pulled in from a"
" version-controlled repository but here I have my Terraform spec entered "
"locally. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`, complete the fields as I've done in the"
" example below and click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."
msgstr ""
"Spec Templates are added in the |morpheus| Library (|LibTemSpe| tab). We "
"can pull in the template desde algunos type of repository, como a través "
"de a Github integration, o write nuevo spec directly en the New Spec "
"Template modal. In la mayoría de cases, the spec será pre-existing y "
"pulled in desde a version-controlled repository pero here I have my "
"Terraform spec entered locally. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`, complete los "
"campos as I've done in the example below y click :guilabel:`SAVE "
"CHANGES`."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:26
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the VERSION field at the bottom of the TF Spec Template modal, enter a"
" Terraform version number to force that version to be used. This version "
"is only honored if the Terraform Runtime setting "
"(:menuselection:`Administration --> Settings --> Provisioning`) is set to"
" \"auto\". When \"manual\" is selected as the Terraform Runtime setting, "
"|morpheus| will simply use the version installed on the appliance box."
msgstr ""
"In the VERSION field at the bottom of the TF Spec Template modal, enter a"
" Terraform version number to force that version to be used. This version "
"is solo honored if the Terraform Runtime setting (|AdmSetPro|) se "
"establece en \"auto\". When \"manual\" is selected as the Terraform "
"Runtime setting, |morpheus| will simply use la versión instalado on el "
"appliance box."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:28
msgid "Tip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:28
msgid ""
"When declaring variables, keep in mind that |morpheus| expects users to "
"follow Terraform best practices. For example, when a variable type is not"
" defined, it defaults to string. See `Terraform Documentation "
"<https://www.terraform.io/docs/language/values/variables.html>`_ for "
"additional resources on variable declaration."
msgstr ""
"When declaring variables, keep in mind that |morpheus| expects users to "
"follow Terraform best practices. Por ejemplo, when a variable type is not"
" defined, it defaults to string. See `Terraform Documentation "
"<https://www.terraform.io/docs/language/values/variables.html>`_ for "
"additional resources on variable declaration."

