#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:165
msgid "Inputs and Option Lists"
msgstr "Inputs y Option Lists"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:167
msgid ""
"In order to create the Layout later in the guide, I need to create four "
"Inputs so the user can make certain selections at provision time. I wrote"
" my Terraform Configuration with this flexibility in mind so that the "
"same Instance Type can be reused in different scenarios. In this "
"particular case, I'm populating the Inputs with manual Option Lists but "
"they can also be populated through REST calls or calls to the |morpheus| "
"API when needed."
msgstr ""
"Para create the Layout later in the guide, I need para crear four Inputs "
"so el usuario can make certain selections at provision time. I wrote my "
"Terraform Configuration con this flexibility in mind so that the mismo "
"Instance Type puede ser reused in diferente scenarios. In this particular"
" case, I'm populating the Inputs con manual Option Lists pero they can "
"también be populated a través de REST calls o calls to the |morpheus| API"
" when needed."

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:169
msgid ""
"Option Lists are created in the Library (|Lib|) under the Option Lists "
"tab. These are lists of items which will be used to create dropdown "
"selections at provision time. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`, complete the "
"fields as I've done in the example below and click :guilabel:`SAVE "
"CHANGES`. I've created one each for the AWS account selection, region "
"selection, and CIDR mask input."
msgstr ""
"Option Lists are created in the Library (|Lib|) under the Option Lists "
"tab. These are lists of items which será used crear dropdown selections "
"at provision time. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`, complete the fields as I've "
"done in the example abajo y click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`. I've created "
"one each for the AWS account selection, region selection, y CIDR mask "
"input."

