"Inputs are también created in the Library under the Inputs tab. In this "
"case, I'm creating four Inputs. Three of them will display as dropdown "
"selections y será tied to one of the Option Lists we just made. The otros"
" será a simple text input where el usuario can indicate the total number "
"of subnets that debería ser created. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`, complete "
"los campos as I've done in the example below y click :guilabel:`SAVE "
"CHANGES`."

