#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:198
msgid "Provisioning"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:200
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now, we're ready to provision new infrastructure into AWS using "
"|morpheus| and Terraform. Just like any other Instance Type, we begin "
"from the Instances list page (:menuselection:`Provisioning --> "
"Instances`) and click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. Select the Instance Type we've "
"just created and move on to the GROUP tab of the wizard. Here you'll give"
" the new instance a name and select your Group and Cloud. Once finished, "
"you'll move on to the CONFIGURE tab where we'll see the Inputs we created"
" and associated with the Layout. Once finished with this tab, step "
"through the rest of the wizard to complete the process. You can see the "
"options I've selected for this configuration in the image below."
msgstr ""
"Now, we're ready to provision nuevo infrastructure en AWS using "
"|morpheus| y Terraform. Just like cualquier otros Instance Type, we begin"
" desde the Instances list page (|ProIns|) y click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. "
"Select the Instance Type we've just created y move on to the GROUP tab of"
" the wizard. Here you'll give the nuevo instance a name y select your "
"Group y Cloud. Once finished, you'll move on to the CONFIGURE tab where "
"we'll see the Inputs we created y asociado con the Layout. Once finished "
"con this tab, step a través de the rest of the wizard to complete el "
"proceso. You can see las opciones I've selected for this configuration in"
" the image below."

