#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:217
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will also regularly check for drift from the Terraform "
"configuration. On the State tab near the top is a \"Drift Status\" "
"indicator. This will either show Drift or No Drift depending on the "
"situation. |morpheus| will automatically check for drift every few "
"minutes but you can perform a manual check at any time by clicking "
":guilabel:`REFRESH STATE`. Drift can be corrected when needed by "
"reapplying state (:guilabel:`APPLY STATE` button)."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| will también regularly check for drift desde the Terraform "
"configuration. On the State tab near the top is a \"Drift Status\" "
"indicator. This will ya sea show Drift o No Drift dependiendo de the "
"situation. |morpheus| will automatically check for drift cada few minutes"
" pero you can perform a manual check at cualquier time by clicking "
":guilabel:`REFRESH STATE`. Drift puede ser corrected when needed by "
"reapplying state (:guilabel:`APPLY STATE` button)."

